OL,3,GNEWSABurnham invites Swinney to work
OL,4,Atogether on 'deeper Scottish
OL,5,Adevolution'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking at an event in Motherwell,
OL,8,FBurnham called for further powers to be
OL,9,Fdevolved from Holyrood to local areas
OL,10,Fbefore that happened.
OL,12,FSNP minister Stephen Flynn said the
OL,13,Fparty had been calling for increased
OL,14,Fdevolved powers since the Smith
OL,15,FCommission report was published in
OL,16,F2014.
